kground-image:linear-gradient(155deg, #171717 0%, #0f0f0f 100%)"></div><div class="absolute filter blur-[36px]" style="left:2%;top:-35%;width:204%;height:247%;background:radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(59,130,246,0.3) 45%, rgba(59,130,246,0.13) 75%, rgba(59,130,246,0) 100%);border-radius:41% 59% 48% 52% / 63% 37% 63% 37%"></div><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,10,10,0.12) 0%, rgba(10,10,10,0.4) 100%)"></div><div class="agent-noise absolute inset-0"></div><div class="agent-noise agent-noise-soft absolute inset-0"></div></div></div><div class="relative flex items-center gap-4 pt-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-10 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full ring-1 ring-white/20" style="background:hsl(217 60% 16%)"><span class="absolute size-7 -left-1 -top-1 motion-safe:animate-[orbit_7s_linear_infinite]" style="transform-origin:65% 65%;animation-duration:7s"><span class="block size-full rounded-full blur-[6px]" style="background:hsl(217 90% 62%);opacity:0.9"></span></span><span class="absolute size-7 -right-1 top-2 motion-safe:animate-[counter-orbit_5s_linear_infinite]" style="transform-origin:65% 65%;animation-duration:5s"><span class="block size-full rounded-full blur-[6px]" style="background:hsl(252 90% 62%);opacity:0.9"></span></span><span class="absolute size-7 left-1 -bottom-2 motion-safe:animate-[orbit_7s_linear_infinite]" style="transform-origin:65% 65%;animation-duration:9s"><span class="block size-full rounded-full blur-[6px]" style="background:hsl(182 90% 62%);opacity:0.9"></span></span><span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_35%_25%,rgba(255,255,255,0.45),transparent_55%)]"></span></span><div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold leading-tight text-white">Query-Time Purview &amp; RBAC</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-white/45">Access Control</p></div></div><p class="relative mt-5 max-w-[340px] text-sm leading-[1.55] font-light text-white/70">The #1 enterprise fear with AI search (oversharing) is architecturally prevented. Every query filters results per user. If someone can&#x27;t open a file in OneDrive, they cannot see or query it.</p></div><ul class="mt-3 border-b border-border/40"><li class="border-t border-border/40 first:border-t-0"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="group/row flex w-full items-baseline gap-[10px] py-[12px] text-left cursor-pointer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-3 w-3 shrink-0 translate-y-[1px] text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200 group-hover/row:text-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg><span class="text-[13.5px] leading-[1.5] font-light transition-colors duration-200 text-foreground/80 group-hover/row:text-foreground">Fail-Closed</span></button></li><li class="border-t border-border/40 first:border-t-0"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="group/row flex w-full items-baseline gap-[10px] py-[12px] text-left cursor-pointer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-3 w-3 shrink-0 translate-y-[1px] text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200 group-hover/row:text-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg><span class="text-[13.5px] leading-[1.5] font-light transition-colors duration-200 text-foreground/80 group-hover/row:text-foreground">Entra ID Native</span></button></li></ul></article><article class="agent-card flex w-[78vw] max-w-[400px] shrink-0 snap-start flex-col rounded-[24px] p-[26px] transition-colors duration-300"><div class="agent-hero relative overflow-hidden -mx-[26px] -mt-[26px] rounded-t-[24px] px-[26px] pt-[24px] pb-[20px]"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-30 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"><div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image:linear-gradient(155deg, #171717 0%, #0f0f0f 100%)"></div><div class="absolute filter blur-[36px]" style="left:1%;top:-30%;width:202%;height:244%;background:radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(16,185,129,0.3) 45%, rgba(16,185,129,0.13) 75%, rgba(16,185,129,0) 100%);border-radius:57% 43% 36% 64% / 44% 59% 41% 56%"></div><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,10,10,0.12) 0%, rgba(10,10,10,0.4) 100%)"></div><div class="agent-noise absolute inset-0"></div><div class="agent-noise agent-noise-soft absolute inset-0"></div></div></div><div class="relative flex items-center gap-4 pt-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-10 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full ring-1 ring-white/20" style="background:hsl(160 60% 16%)"><span class="absolute size-7 -left-1 -top-1 motion-safe:animate-[orbit_7s_linear_infinite]" style="transform-origin:65% 65%;animation-duration:7s"><span class="block size-full rounded-full blur-[6px]" style="background:hsl(160 90% 62%);opacity:0.9"></span></span><span class="absolute size-7 -right-1 top-2 motion-safe:animate-[counter-orbit_5s_linear_infinite]" style="transform-origin:65% 65%;animation-duration:5s"><span class="block size-full rounded-full blur-[6px]" style="background:hsl(195 90% 62%);opacity:0.9"></span></span><span class="absolute size-7 left-1 -bottom-2 motion-safe:animate-[orbit_7s_linear_infinite]" style="transform-origin:65% 65%;animation-duration:9s"><span class="block size-full rounded-full blur-[6px]" style="background:hsl(125 90% 62%);opacity:0.9"></span></span><span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_35%_25%,rgba(255,255,255,0.45),transparent_55%)]"></span></span><div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold leading-tight text-white">Sub-50ms Desktop Speed</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-white/45">Search Performance</p></div></div><p class="relative mt-5 max-w-[340px] text-sm leading-[1.55] font-light text-white/70">Press Ctrl + Space from any active application. Features boolean operators (AND/OR/NOT), fuzzy matching, multilingual stemming (English + Indonesian), and field boosting.</p></div><ul class="mt-3 border-b border-border/40"><li class="border-t border-border/40 first:border-t-0"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="group/row flex w-full items-baseline gap-[10px] py-[12px] text-left cursor-pointer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-3 w-3 shrink-0 translate-y-[1px] text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200 group-hover/row:text-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg><span class="text-[13.5px] leading-[1.5] font-light transition-colors duration-200 text-foreground/80 group-hover/row:text-foreground">Hybrid Search Core</span></button></li><li class="border-t border-border/40 first:border-t-0"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="group/row flex w-full items-baseline gap-[10px] py-[12px] text-left cursor-pointer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-3 w-3 shrink-0 translate-y-[1px] text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200 group-hover/row:text-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg><span class="text-[13.5px] leading-[1.5] font-light transition-colors duration-200 text-foreground/80 group-hover/row:text-foreground">Instant Launch</span></button></li></ul></article><article class="agent-card flex w-[78vw] max-w-[400px] shrink-0 snap-start flex-col rounded-[24px] p-[26px] transition-colors duration-300"><div class="agent-hero relative overflow-hidden -mx-[26px] -mt-[26px] rounded-t-[24px] px-[26px] pt-[24px] pb-[20px]"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-30 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"><div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image:linear-gradient(155deg, #171717 0%, #0f0f0f 100%)"></div><div class="absolute filter blur-[36px]" style="left:-2%;top:-45%;width:204%;height:252%;background:radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(245,158,11,0.3) 45%, rgba(245,158,11,0.13) 75%, rgba(245,158,11,0) 100%);border-radius:66% 34% 42% 58% / 48% 55% 45% 52%"></div><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,10,10,0.12) 0%, rgba(10,10,10,0.4) 100%)"></div><div class="agent-noise absolute inset-0"></div><div class="agent-noise agent-noise-soft absolute inset-0"></div></div></div><div class="relative flex items-center gap-4 pt-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-10 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full ring-1 ring-white/20" style="background:hsl(38 60% 16%)"><span class="absolute size-7 -left-1 -top-1 motion-safe:animate-[orbit_7s_linear_infinite]" style="transform-origin:65% 65%;animation-duration:7s"><span class="block size-full rounded-full blur-[6px]" style="background:hsl(38 90% 62%);opacity:0.9"></span></span><span class="absolute size-7 -right-1 top-2 motion-safe:animate-[counter-orbit_5s_linear_infinite]" style="transform-origin:65% 65%;animation-duration:5s"><span class="block size-full rounded-full blur-[6px]" style="background:hsl(73 90% 62%);opacity:0.9"></span></span><span class="absolute size-7 left-1 -bottom-2 motion-safe:animate-[orbit_7s_linear_infinite]" style="transform-origin:65% 65%;animation-duration:9s"><span class="block size-full rounded-full blur-[6px]" style="background:hsl(8 90% 62%);opacity:0.9"></span></span><span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_35%_25%,rgba(255,255,255,0.45),transparent_55%)]"></span></span><div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold leading-tight text-white">Intelligent On-Device Rename</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-white/45">On-Device AI</p></div></div><p class="relative mt-5 max-w-[340px] text-sm leading-[1.55] font-light text-white/70">Eliminate chaotic downloads like `download(3).pdf`. A lightweight on-device neural model reads document structure and proposes standardized, clutter-free naming conventions.</p></div><ul class="mt-3 border-b border-border/40"><li class="border-t border-border/40 first:border-t-0"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="group/row flex w-full items-baseline gap-[10px] py-[12px] text-left cursor-pointer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-3 w-3 shrink-0 translate-y-[1px] text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200 group-hover/row:text-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg><span class="text-[13.5px] leading-[1.5] font-light transition-colors duration-200 text-foreground/80 group-hover/row:text-foreground">On-Device Neural</span></button></li><li class="border-t border-border/40 first:border-t-0"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="group/row flex w-full items-baseline gap-[10px] py-[12px] text-left cursor-pointer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-3 w-3 shrink-0 translate-y-[1px] text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200 group-hover/row:text-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg><span class="text-[13.5px] leading-[1.5] font-light transition-colors duration-200 text-foreground/80 group-hover/row:text-foreground">Zero Privacy Leak</span></button></li></ul></article><article class="agent-card flex w-[78vw] max-w-[400px] shrink-0 snap-start flex-col rounded-[24px] p-[26px] transition-colors duration-300"><div class="agent-hero relative overflow-hidden -mx-[26px] -mt-[26px] rounded-t-[24px] px-[26px] pt-[24px] pb-[20px]"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-30 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"><div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image:linear-gradient(155deg, #171717 0%, #0f0f0f 100%)"></div><div class="absolute filter blur-[36px]" style="left:0%;top:-30%;width:200%;height:247%;background:radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(168,85,247,0.3) 45%, rgba(168,85,247,0.13) 75%, rgba(168,85,247,0) 100%);border-radius:57% 43% 36% 64% / 44% 59% 41% 56%"></div><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,10,10,0.12) 0%, rgba(10,10,10,0.4) 100%)"></div><div class="agent-noise absolute inset-0"></div><div class="agent-noise agent-noise-soft absolute inset-0"></div></div></div><div class="relative flex items-center gap-4 pt-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-10 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full ring-1 ring-white/20" style="background:hsl(270 60% 16%)"><span class="absolute size-7 -left-1 -top-1 motion-safe:animate-[orbit_7s_linear_infinite]" style="transform-origin:65% 65%;animation-duration:7s"><span class="block size-full rounded-full blur-[6px]" style="background:hsl(270 90% 62%);opacity:0.9"></span></span><span class="absolute size-7 -right-1 top-2 motion-safe:animate-[counter-orbit_5s_linear_infinite]" style="transform-origin:65% 65%;animation-duration:5s"><span class="block size-full rounded-full blur-[6px]" style="background:hsl(305 90% 62%);opacity:0.9"></span></span><span class="absolute size-7 left-1 -bottom-2 motion-safe:animate-[orbit_7s_linear_infinite]" style="transform-origin:65% 65%;animation-duration:9s"><span class="block size-full rounded-full blur-[6px]" style="background:hsl(240 90% 62%);opacity:0.9"></span></span><span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_35%_25%,rgba(255,255,255,0.45),transparent_55%)]"></span></span><div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold leading-tight text-white">Grounded AI Context (RAG)</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-white/45">AI Grounding</p></div></div><p class="relative mt-5 max-w-[340px] text-sm leading-[1.55] font-light text-white/70">Feed ChatGPT, Claude, or local Ollama with verified corporate citations. LLMs receive only permitted departmental snippets, preventing hallucinations and executive data leaks.</p></div><ul class="mt-3 border-b border-border/40"><li class="border-t border-border/40 first:border-t-0"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="group/row flex w-full items-baseline gap-[10px] py-[12px] text-left cursor-pointer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-3 w-3 shrink-0 translate-y-[1px] text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200 group-hover/row:text-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg><span class="text-[13.5px] leading-[1.5] font-light transition-colors duration-200 text-foreground/80 group-hover/row:text-foreground">Zero Hallucinations</span></button></li><li class="border-t border-border/40 first:border-t-0"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="group/row flex w-full items-baseline gap-[10px] py-[12px] text-left cursor-pointer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-3 w-3 shrink-0 translate-y-[1px] text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200 group-hover/row:text-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg><span class="text-[13.5px] leading-[1.5] font-light transition-colors duration-200 text-foreground/80 group-hover/row:text-foreground">Model Agnostic</span></button></li></ul></article><article class="agent-card flex w-[78vw] max-w-[400px] shrink-0 snap-start flex-col rounded-[24px] p-[26px] transition-colors duration-300"><div class="agent-hero relative overflow-hidden -mx-[26px] -mt-[26px] rounded-t-[24px] px-[26px] pt-[24px] pb-[20px]"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-30 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"><div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image:linear-gradient(155deg, #171717 0%, #0f0f0f 100%)"></div><div class="absolute filter blur-[36px]" style="left:-4%;top:-45%;width:204%;height:252%;background:radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(6,182,212,0.3) 45%, rgba(6,182,212,0.13) 75%, rgba(6,182,212,0) 100%);border-radius:66% 34% 42% 58% / 48% 55% 45% 52%"></div><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,10,10,0.12) 0%, rgba(10,10,10,0.4) 100%)"></div><div class="agent-noise absolute inset-0"></div><div class="agent-noise agent-noise-soft absolute inset-0"></div></div></div><div class="relative flex items-center gap-4 pt-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-10 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full ring-1 ring-white/20" style="background:hsl(189 60% 16%)"><span class="absolute size-7 -left-1 -top-1 motion-safe:animate-[orbit_7s_linear_infinite]" style="transform-origin:65% 65%;animation-duration:7s"><span class="block size-full rounded-full blur-[6px]" style="background:hsl(189 90% 62%);opacity:0.9"></span></span><span class="absolute size-7 -right-1 top-2 motion-safe:animate-[counter-orbit_5s_linear_infinite]" style="transform-origin:65% 65%;animation-duration:5s"><span class="block size-full rounded-full blur-[6px]" style="background:hsl(224 90% 62%);opacity:0.9"></span></span><span class="absolute size-7 left-1 -bottom-2 motion-safe:animate-[orbit_7s_linear_infinite]" style="transform-origin:65% 65%;animation-duration:9s"><span class="block size-full rounded-full blur-[6px]" style="background:hsl(154 90% 62%);opacity:0.9"></span></span><span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_35%_25%,rgba(255,255,255,0.45),transparent_55%)]"></span></span><div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold leading-tight text-white">Self-Hosted Private Stack</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-white/45">Deployment</p></div></div><p class="relative mt-5 max-w-[340px] text-sm leading-[1.55] font-light text-white/70">Deploy entirely within your enterprise tenant or private VPC. Secrets rotated in HashiCorp Vault with KMS auto-unseal. Client certificates verified at proxy edge with CRL checking.</p></div><ul class="mt-3 border-b border-border/40"><li class="border-t border-border/40 first:border-t-0"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="group/row flex w-full items-baseline gap-[10px] py-[12px] text-left cursor-pointer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-3 w-3 shrink-0 translate-y-[1px] text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200 group-hover/row:text-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg><span class="text-[13.5px] leading-[1.5] font-light transition-colors duration-200 text-foreground/80 group-hover/row:text-foreground">Vault KMS Unseal</span></button></li><li class="border-t border-border/40 first:border-t-0"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="group/row flex w-full items-baseline gap-[10px] py-[12px] text-left cursor-pointer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-3 w-3 shrink-0 translate-y-[1px] text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200 group-hover/row:text-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg><span class="text-[13.5px] leading-[1.5] font-light transition-colors duration-200 text-foreground/80 group-hover/row:text-foreground">mTLS Hardened</span></button></li></ul></article></div></div></section><section id="manifesto" class="w-full px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 md:py-24"><div class="manifesto-track relative"><div class="sp-manifesto-card manifesto-permission flex items-center overflow-hidden"><div aria-hidden="true" class="manifesto-perimeter pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"><div class="mp-grid"></div><div class="mp-rings"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class="mp-scan"></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="manifesto-ambient pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 "><div class="mp-card mp-card-1"><div class="mp-card-inner"><span class="mp-card-source mp-source-blue">OneDrive Business</span><span class="mp-card-title">Q3_Financial_Audit.xlsx</span><span class="mp-card-meta">M365 ACL Synchronized</span></div></div><div class="mp-card mp-card-2"><div class="mp-card-inner"><span class="mp-card-source mp-source-green">HashiCorp Vault</span><span class="mp-card-title">KMS Auto-Unseal Active</span><span class="mp-card-meta">Zero Stored Credentials</span></div></div><div class="mp-card mp-card-3"><div class="mp-card-inner"><span class="mp-card-source mp-source-purple">Hybrid Search Engine</span><span class="mp-card-title">Sub-50ms Multilingual Retrieval</span><span class="mp-card-meta">English + Indonesian Stemming</span></div></div><div class="mp-card mp-card-4"><div class="mp-card-inner"><span class="mp-card-source mp-source-red">Security Barrier</span><span class="mp-card-title">Zero Document Retention</span><span class="mp-card-meta">Fail-Closed Authorization</span></div></div></div><div class="mp-copy"><h2 class="section-title font-display font-light text-balance mp-title text-xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl leading-[1.25]">Enterprise search failed because it copied files into secondary silos. The future of knowledge belongs to the<!-- --> <span class="mp-highlight">zero-retention, permission-true layer.</span></h2><p class="mp-desc">No duplicated file liabilities. No accidental oversharing leaks. Every document stays in its source, protected by the exact same purview that governs your company.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="architecture" class="relative scroll-mt-[80px] w-full px-4 sm:px-6 py-20 md:py-28 overflow-hidden bg-[#f8fafc] dark:bg-[#0d0d0d] transition-colors duration-200"><div id="how-it-works" class="absolute -top-20"></div><div id="knowledge-layer" class="absolute -top-20"></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-[120px] left-1/2 -z-10 size-[900px] -translate-x-1/2 md:size-[1400px] hidden dark:block"><svg viewBox="0 0 1502 1502" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-full opacity-60"><circle cx="751" cy="751" r="751" fill="url(#arch-hero-ellipse)"></circle><defs><radialGradient id="arch-hero-ellipse" cx="0" cy="0" r="1" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse" gradientTransform="translate(751 751) rotate(90) scale(751)"><stop stop-color="#403737"></stop><stop offset="1" stop-color="#0D0D0D" stop-opacity="0"></stop></radialGradient></defs></svg></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1340px]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between mb-10 lg:mb-14"><h2 class="max-w-[584px] font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-[46px] leading-[1.15] font-light text-balance text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Inside the Knowledge Layer.</h2><p class="max-w-[420px] text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed font-light text-slate-600 dark:text-white/55 md:text-right">Not another tool on the side — SearchPoint lives inside your organization, wired into how it actually runs.</p></div><div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-6 lg:gap-0 lg:grid lg:items-stretch lg:grid-cols-[1fr_40px_1.06fr_40px_1fr]"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="relative flex min-h-[340px] flex-1 flex-col justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-[14px] border border-slate-200/80 bg-white p-5 sm:p-[28px] shadow-sm dark:border-white/12 dark:bg-[#121212] dark:shadow-none"><span class="absolute top-[18px] left-[22px] z-10 text-[11px] leading-none font-medium tracking-[0.14em] text-slate-400 dark:text-white/40 uppercase">Data Platform</span><div class="relative pt-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-0 w-full"><div class="relative flex-1"><div aria-hidden="true" class="arch-bus-line absolute top-[14px] right-0 bottom-[14px] w-px" style="background:repeating-linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.3) 0 4px, transparent 4px 9px)"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-[7px]"><div class="flex items-center"><span class="flex h-[26px] items-center gap-[6px] rounded-[10px] border border-slate-200/80 bg-slate-50/80 px-[9px] text-[10.5px] leading-none font-light whitespace-nowrap text-slate-700 shadow-sm dark:border-white/12 dark:bg-[#111112] dark:text-white/80"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-[9px] w-[14px]"><path d="M6.5 15C3.46 15 1 12.65 1 9.75C1 7.15 2.95 5.03 5.5 4.83C6.6 2.05 9.47 0 12.92 0C16.7 0 19.88 2.76 20.29 6.42C22.38 7.11 23.9 9.12 23.9 11.45C23.9 13.96 21.89 15 19.46 15H6.5Z" fill="#0078D4"></path><path d="M17.46 15C19.89 15 23.9 13.96 23.9 11.45C23.9 9.12 22.38 7.11 20.29 6.42C19.7 6.22 19.08 6.12 18.44 6.12C16.48 6.12 14.77 7.12 13.78 8.65C15.28 9.7 16.27 11.45 16.27 13.43C16.27 13.98 16.17 14.51 15.98 15H17.46Z" fill="#0364B8"></path></svg>OneDrive</span><div aria-hidden="true" class="nx-hiwd-dash h-px min-w-[10px] flex-1" style="background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.3) 0 4px, transparent 4px 9